Control committees of workers and housewives visit the markets and the warehouses. They find hoarded potatoes, and post the names of the hoarders on factory notice boards.

@real_values
subtitle: The Right's line: a demand for the unions and the Reichstag.
on-arrival: worker_support += 2; uspd_relation += 3; spd_relation += 2; unionist_satisfaction += 5; lean_unionist += 2

The party's demand, that the state take a share of every factory and estate instead of printing money, is taken up by union branches in Saxony and Thuringia. The ADGB's leaders say it is worth discussing, which is more than they have ever said about any demand of ours.

@hunger
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The Left's line. The unemployed are with us; the police are waiting.
on-arrival: militancy += 5; repression += 5; worker_support += 1; offensive_satisfaction += 5; district_berlin_loyalty += 5; lean_offensive += 2

Columns of the unemployed march on the Berlin city hall behind our banners. Windows are broken, and so are heads.
